    body: "If the next session is within 8 hours: 1.0–1.2 g/kg of carbohydrate per hour for the first 4 hours, plus 20–40 g of protein within the first hour or two. If the next session is a day away, the timing does not matter; the day's totals do. Protein 0.3–0.4 g/kg per meal, 3–4 times a day, and 30–40 g before sleep on heavy days, supports muscle repair. Alcohol after training slows glycogen and protein recovery and worsens sleep.",
