    body: "Monday–Wednesday: short sessions with a few race-pace minutes, bike checked, bags packed from a written list. Thursday: travel or rest. Friday: 20-minute swim in the race water if allowed, 20-minute spin, bike racked, bags dropped. Saturday: 15-minute jog with strides, feet up, dinner by 18:00 with low fibre, everything laid out, alarm set for 3.5 hours before the start. Race morning: breakfast at 3 hours out, sunscreen and chamois cream before the wetsuit, 30 g of carbohydrate 15 minutes before the swim. Nothing new in race week: no new shoes, food, position or product.",
